    "content" : "Let F be a totally real ﬁeld of degree N over in which p is inert. We label the set of real embeddings of F by {τ1,...,τN} as before. Let E/F be an imaginary quadratic extension in which pOE = qqc. Each τi extends to complex embeddings τi (over q) and τci (over qc). For a tuple of integers (mi,ni)1≤i≤N such that mi + ni = n, let G be the unitary group over , with signature at inﬁnite places given by (mi,ni)1≤i≤N, i.e.,"
